     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Am I correct in the assumption that the command for freeing residual variances (which were fixed for testing strict invariance) would be for example for the variable m1:</div><div><br></div><div>group.partial = c(&quot;m1 ~~ m1&quot;) ?</div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
